Kostadis Roussos: Right.

812
00:58:00.939 --> 00:58:11.819
Kostadis Roussos: And, you know, the clerics of Lathander are like ecstatic to have this like Drow want to be one of them because it's kind of like proves the righteousness of their god that even the drow would worship.

