Gary Young: Sure, yeah.

814
00:58:13.179 --> 00:58:13.579
Gary Young: All right.

815
00:58:14.779 --> 00:58:19.739
Kostadis Roussos: If that worked for them, I'm just telling you why they would be excited by this.

816
00:58:19.899 --> 00:58:22.299
