817
00:58:23.659 --> 00:58:28.219
UNKNOWN: Okay, so like her first exposure to the sun is a very religious experience.

818
00:58:28.539 --> 00:58:29.019
Kostadis Roussos: Yes, yes.

819
00:58:30.059 --> 00:58:37.899
Gary Young: She's bored by it and then you know, wanders into town and then keeps going with us.

820
00:58:38.059 --> 00:58:38.219
Gary Young: Yeah.

821
00:58:39.099 --> 00:58:39.339
Kostadis Roussos: Right.

822
00:58:39.739 --> 00:58:44.699
Kostadis Roussos: And, you know, since she's interested in paint, but you know, Neverwinter is too civilized.

823
00:58:45.339 --> 00:58:46.460
Kostadis Roussos [?]: Too civilized.

824
00:58:46.779 --> 00:58:47.899
Kostadis Roussos: Well, she is a drow.

825
00:58:48.139 --> 00:58:49.419
Kostadis Roussos: There's no assassinations going on.

826
00:58:49.579 --> 00:58:50.619
Kostadis Roussos: There's no torture racks.

827
00:58:50.779 --> 00:58:55.819
Kostadis Roussos: There's, you know, there's no open-air slave markets.

828
00:58:55.980 --> 00:58:59.339
Kostadis Roussos: There's no conspiracies to destroy other noble houses.

829
00:58:59.500 --> 00:59:00.619
Kostadis Roussos: It's all very boring.

830
00:59:00.939 --> 00:59:05.179
Kostadis Roussos: So when she sees the flyer, she decides that this would be more painful.

831
00:59:06.059 --> 00:59:06.699
Gary Young: Yeah, okay.

832
00:59:06.859 --> 00:59:07.179
Gary Young: There we go.

833
00:59:07.339 --> 00:59:07.980
Gary Young: That's a motivation.

834
00:59:09.099 --> 00:59:11.500
Kostadis Roussos: She's like, you know, this is just boring.

835
00:59:12.139 --> 00:59:13.019
Kostadis Roussos: Yes, boring.

836
00:59:13.339 --> 00:59:13.500
Kostadis Roussos: Right.

837
00:59:13.659 --> 00:59:21.739
Kostadis Roussos: And she's learned from hanging out amongst the upper world that people don't take kindly when you rob or kill or torture people at random.

838
00:59:21.819 --> 00:59:23.579
David Mendenhall: I've got to spend money from monsters in this place, though.

839
00:59:24.299 --> 00:59:28.139
Kostadis Roussos: Yes, which the drow is totally cool with.

840
00:59:28.779 --> 00:59:30.460
Kostadis Roussos [?]: Yeah, yeah, I think we're good with that.

841
00:59:33.980 --> 00:59:34.299
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

