00:59:38.299 --> 00:59:39.099
Kostadis Roussos [?]: Music?

844
00:59:39.419 --> 00:59:45.259
Kostadis Roussos: No, no, like about like, is Varoujan's music something that the Drow knows about?

845
00:59:45.500 --> 00:59:48.059
Kostadis Roussos: Or is she like, you know, is he so obscure?

846
00:59:50.139 --> 00:59:52.460
David Mendenhall[?]: I don't know why she would care about music.

847
00:59:53.019 --> 00:59:53.500
Kostadis Roussos: Exactly.

848
00:59:53.579 --> 00:59:55.339
David Mendenhall[?]: I'm just saying she would never have heard of his music.

849
00:59:55.500 --> 00:59:56.219
UNKNOWN: That's what I'm asking.

850
00:59:56.539 --> 00:59:57.500
David Mendenhall: That's fine.

851
00:59:59.099 --> 01:00:01.659
Gary Young: I don't think she's necessarily a luck.

852
01:00:02.939 --> 01:00:05.899
Gary Young: So that doesn't work out.

853
01:00:06.779 --> 01:00:06.939
Kostadis Roussos: Okay.

854
01:00:07.579 --> 01:00:08.299
Kostadis Roussos: So that's fine.

855
01:00:09.019 --> 01:00:12.699
Kostadis Roussos: She could also have a dim view of music played by Aasimar.

